583
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,250
Have you considered it?

584
00:32:30,220 --> 00:32:32,020
Didn't we already agree on this?

585
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:34,400
I'll leave after finishing Light Chaser.

586
00:32:35,110 --> 00:32:36,110
Yeah.

587
00:32:37,470 --> 00:32:38,320
Light Chaser

588
00:32:38,350 --> 00:32:40,350
