on track, step by step.

592
00:32:46,570 --> 00:32:47,570
So?

593
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:49,269
So I run the company.

594
00:32:49,270 --> 00:32:50,510
I'm a professional.

595
00:32:51,250 --> 00:32:52,160
But when it comes to technology,

596
00:32:52,161 --> 00:32:53,480
I don't know anything.

597
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:54,809
I need one of my own

598
00:32:54,810 --> 00:32:56,140
to keep an eye on things.

599
00:33:09,460 --> 00:33:11,060
How is Grandma doing lately?

600
00:33:11,860 --> 00:33:13,660
Sometimes good, sometimes bad.

601
00:33:13,770 --> 00:33:15,370
Do you still visit her often?

602
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:20,620
Does she still often
mistake you for Jiang Yuan?

603
00:33:24,570 --> 00:33:25,630
Forget I said that.

604
00:33:34,500 --> 00:33:35,290
Then, regarding the digital twin,

605
00:33:35,291 --> 00:33:37,550
