606
00:33:39,090 --> 00:33:40,090
No.

607
00:33:40,290 --> 00:33:41,420
Isn't that perfect?

608
00:33:42,030 --> 00:33:42,700
During this time,

609
00:33:42,701 --> 00:33:44,139
