610
00:33:44,140 --> 00:33:45,000
All our equipment

611
00:33:45,001 --> 00:33:46,739
is the latest and top-notch.

612
00:33:46,740 --> 00:33:47,440
If you work on the digital twin,

613
00:33:47,441 --> 00:33:48,999
you can definitely use them.

614
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:50,000
Look.

615
00:33:50,750 --> 00:33:51,939
We have the equipment.

616
00:33:51,940 --> 00:33:53,766
We have the computing power.
As for your conditions,

617
00:33:53,790 --> 00:33:55,699
you can use anything in the company.

618
00:33:55,700 --> 00:33:56,640
Just stay here with peace of mind

619
00:33:56,641 --> 00:33:57,679
and work on your digital twin.

620
00:33:57,680 --> 00:33:58,680
When you have time,

621
00:33:58,681 --> 00:34:00,810
just help me keep an eye on the company.

622
00:34:05,790 --> 00:34:06,920
I'll think about it.

623
00:34:42,260 --> 00:34:43,260
Still busy?

624
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:44,840
Yuan!

625
00:34:45,510 --> 00:34:46,510
Why are you here?

626
00:34:47,030 --> 00:34:48,030
What,

627
00:34:48,650 --> 00:34:49,960
