632
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:57,839
go our separate ways,

633
00:34:57,840 --> 00:34:59,100
and never speak again?

634
00:34:59,370 --> 00:35:00,370
No.

635
00:35:02,500 --> 00:35:03,500
I know

636
00:35:04,340 --> 00:35:06,029
