637
00:35:06,030 --> 00:35:07,630
and want to share the burden.

638
00:35:10,900 --> 00:35:12,030
I've made up my mind.

639
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:14,880
Moving forward,

640
00:35:15,180 --> 00:35:16,180
let's work on your

641
00:35:16,181 --> 00:35:17,840
smart robotic project first.

642
00:35:25,950 --> 00:35:26,510
Yuan,

643
00:35:26,590 --> 00:35:28,229
