644
00:35:28,230 --> 00:35:29,490
We can work on it later.

645
00:35:29,630 --> 00:35:30,630
It's the same.

646
00:35:35,380 --> 00:35:36,649
You've been working

647
00:35:36,650 --> 00:35:37,530
