648
00:35:37,531 --> 00:35:38,860
You should go to sleep.

649
00:35:39,180 --> 00:35:40,430
Go to bed now.

650
00:35:41,090 --> 00:35:43,330
[Digital twin is operating normally]

651
00:35:53,310 --> 00:35:55,236
[Successfully sent to Idle
Cloud Tick-Tock, He Jiameng]

652
00:35:55,260 --> 00:35:56,170
Ms. He,

653
00:35:56,260 --> 00:35:58,049
