664
00:36:45,610 --> 00:36:46,760
Apartment hunting.

665
00:36:47,260 --> 00:36:48,669
Why are you looking for an apartment?

666
00:36:48,670 --> 00:36:49,819
Do you think after that fight

667
00:36:49,820 --> 00:36:51,280
with my Dad,

668
00:36:51,590 --> 00:36:52,520
if I just go back to Xifu

669
00:36:52,521 --> 00:36:54,120
