695
00:37:29,110 --> 00:37:30,240
It's fine.

696
00:37:30,510 --> 00:37:32,049
Xia is very nice.

697
00:37:32,050 --> 00:37:32,650
You'll definitely

698
00:37:32,651 --> 00:37:34,310
