friends when you are out.

706
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:45,820
It's decided then.

707
00:37:46,010 --> 00:37:47,860
That's true.

708
00:38:01,050 --> 00:38:02,629
This Xia really...

709
00:38:02,630 --> 00:38:03,130
Why is she not coming out

710
00:38:03,131 --> 00:38:04,440
