711
00:38:04,940 --> 00:38:06,740
Not even laying out a red carpet.

712
00:38:06,960 --> 00:38:07,960
Here?

713
00:38:09,780 --> 00:38:11,910
Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse?

714
00:38:13,410 --> 00:38:16,350
