720
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:25,300
Let me show you.

721
00:38:26,630 --> 00:38:27,830
Puppy, open the door.

722
00:38:30,050 --> 00:38:31,590
Puppy, open the door.

723
00:38:33,230 --> 00:38:34,859
